    "Resolution applies to the observed retained camera-joint bitmap only on the specifically recorded supplemental prepared build and source pins.",
    "The pointer canvas begins empty, so these cases do not prove clearing of a previously painted pointer. Source ownership is shared but source inspection cannot substitute for that missing rendered case.",
    "DPR2 uses the desktop layout and is not mobile proof. Mobile stop, reduced motion, accessibility and conventional return remain outside this focused review.",
    "The repaired-source original Laboratory cohort remains 8 of 10: photo target-3 hand-selection hold and viewport reason assertion failures are preserved and are not converted to passes by these two focused cases.",
    "The full photographic training and independent-check sequence did not complete on this repaired source. Earlier source success is not reused as current-source proof.",
